    "description": "Volumes of activated balancing energy, settled reserve and emergency energy. **note: This API is subject to rate limiting**\n\nThe following rate limits apply:\n\n**Production and Acceptance**\n- Maximum requests per second: 1\n- Maximum requests per minute: 60\n- Maximum requests per day: 1500\n\nExceeding these limits may result in temporary blocking of your API keys. Please ensure your usage adheres to these limits to maintain uninterrupted access."
